<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1104_3529.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Min <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früendtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpüerlich</unclear> willig dienst, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>
